Package: claude-cn
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: claude-cn contributors <maintainers@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), iproute2, nftables, iptables, iputils-ping, socat, libseccomp2, systemd, adduser, ca-certificates, procps
Description: Generic Claude Code provider launcher with mainland egress policy
 Runs Claude Code in a dedicated routed network namespace. Mainland and
 configured LAN destinations allow direct TCP, UDP and ICMP. Foreign
 destinations require explicit HTTP CONNECT domain allowlisting.
 Includes independent provider configuration (Zhipu by default), arbitrary
 compatible API endpoints and configurable Claude executable discovery.
 Claude Code itself must be installed separately; no GLM wrapper is required.
